  "details": "Many rp communities in vrchat spectate their events. This is to record videos of the event or ensure rp stays fair to all participants. The ability to fly and increase walk speed would be an immense help to spectate these events. Of course allowing every user in vrchat to fly could still ruins some experiences so the ability for an instance creator or world creator to allow users to fly would be a good option. Thank you!",
